WEBVTT

00:01:39.700 --> 00:01:44.120
You just couldn't hold back, could you?

00:01:45.250 --> 00:01:46.620
It's you...

00:01:48.250 --> 00:01:50.630
I can't fuckin' stand the rules of EVOL.

00:01:52.590 --> 00:01:55.380
Don't tell me what to do!

00:01:55.380 --> 00:01:58.300
In any case, if you're going to unleash your power,

00:02:02.180 --> 00:02:05.390
let's do something useful with it.

00:02:05.390 --> 00:02:05.730
<b>Fire in an empty
shopping mall</b>

00:02:05.730 --> 00:02:09.810
In the past two weeks there have been ten incidents of arson.

00:02:09.810 --> 00:02:12.480
According to investigations from the police and fire departments,

00:02:12.480 --> 00:02:14.480
the criminal stays at the scene of the crime for a long period of time...

00:02:15.280 --> 00:02:16.400
Jin...

00:02:17.150 --> 00:02:19.160
If someone has to do something about this...

00:02:23.780 --> 00:02:25.450
I'll become justice!

00:02:25.450 --> 00:02:28.960
Episode 2: Inside The Flames

00:02:28.960 --> 00:02:34.500
That's all I have to report regarding the upcoming company merger,

00:02:34.500 --> 00:02:35.550
Mr. President!

00:02:35.550 --> 00:02:39.340
I think that the family of our parent company, Amagi Corporation,

00:02:39.340 --> 00:02:41.340
is about to grow one company larger.

00:02:41.340 --> 00:02:43.350
Yeah. Thanks for your hard work!

00:02:44.010 --> 00:02:46.520
That ends our board meeting.

00:02:46.520 --> 00:02:48.180
Any questions?

00:02:49.350 --> 00:02:52.400
How are things going on with the Undertown redevelopment?

00:02:52.400 --> 00:02:55.190
Kabe, I believe I left this up to you.

00:02:55.190 --> 00:02:58.860
Soon I'll be able to show you the whole plan.

00:02:59.320 --> 00:03:02.200
If I can just have a bit more time...

00:03:02.200 --> 00:03:03.240
All right.

00:03:03.240 --> 00:03:06.120
As long as we don't clean up the scum in that town,

00:03:06.120 --> 00:03:08.040
Tokyo won't be complete.

00:03:08.040 --> 00:03:09.330
Hurry!

00:03:09.330 --> 00:03:09.870
Yes, sir!

00:03:10.460 --> 00:03:16.090
By the way, please don't forget about the
event at the Amagi Grand Hotel tonight at six.

00:03:16.090 --> 00:03:17.960
Kouga's, right?

00:03:29.100 --> 00:03:30.480
What happened?

00:03:30.480 --> 00:03:33.560
Dake-san bumped into Toku-san, and...

00:03:33.560 --> 00:03:34.520
Look.

00:03:35.190 --> 00:03:37.480
It spilled all over, so they're fighting.

00:03:37.980 --> 00:03:39.610
Mum, what should we do?

00:03:39.610 --> 00:03:41.110
You should just let it be.

00:03:41.530 --> 00:03:44.620
Everybody's pissed off because there are no jobs.

00:03:45.490 --> 00:03:46.780
That's...

00:03:49.910 --> 00:03:51.620
Please stop!

00:03:51.620 --> 00:03:53.540
You can't fight!

00:03:53.540 --> 00:03:54.790
Konoha!

00:03:55.330 --> 00:03:57.500
Both of you, calm down!

00:03:57.500 --> 00:03:58.840
You bastard!

00:04:00.760 --> 00:04:02.340
Stop!

00:04:07.810 --> 00:04:10.810
W-What the heck, it's Nii-chan.

00:04:10.810 --> 00:04:12.180
Out of the way, kid!

00:04:14.690 --> 00:04:16.150
I'm not moving.

00:04:16.150 --> 00:04:17.980
Isn't everyone in trouble 'cause of you?

00:04:19.110 --> 00:04:20.740
Do you still have food left?

00:04:20.740 --> 00:04:21.990
Y-Yes!

00:04:22.610 --> 00:04:25.240
If you fight, you'll just get even hungrier.

00:04:25.820 --> 00:04:28.580
Don't let their kindness be for nothing.

00:04:28.580 --> 00:04:29.990
Hey!

00:04:30.450 --> 00:04:31.750
What're you doing?

00:04:32.290 --> 00:04:33.250
Let's go.

00:04:41.550 --> 00:04:43.380
I knew it...

00:04:44.260 --> 00:04:46.260
Wait, Jin-kun!

00:04:49.390 --> 00:04:50.600
Helping people out...

00:04:52.430 --> 00:04:53.850
You're doing it, aren't you?

00:04:59.190 --> 00:05:01.570
He's the kid from that night, right?

00:05:01.570 --> 00:05:02.820
Yeah.

00:05:02.820 --> 00:05:05.910
Kono-chan, you're an acquaintance of Jin's?

00:05:05.910 --> 00:05:08.200
Yes. I just know him a little...

00:05:08.200 --> 00:05:11.830
He's working as a bodyguard for guys like that,

00:05:11.830 --> 00:05:15.370
but he protects us from violence.

00:05:15.370 --> 00:05:17.630
He's a nice guy.

00:05:24.340 --> 00:05:26.180
How did you know we were here?

00:05:26.180 --> 00:05:27.510
It's fine.

00:05:27.510 --> 00:05:30.140
I'll keep it a secret from the president.

00:05:30.140 --> 00:05:33.060
But you need to attend the party tonight.

00:05:33.430 --> 00:05:35.940
Your clothes are already prepared for you at the hotel.

00:05:36.520 --> 00:05:38.650
You've really prepared for this.

00:05:38.650 --> 00:05:40.310
Thank you.

00:05:40.310 --> 00:05:41.940
Konoha-san, come with her, too.

00:05:45.190 --> 00:05:46.700
CREPES

00:05:47.530 --> 00:05:49.030
You don't seem busy.

00:05:55.120 --> 00:05:57.710
This spot is a total failure.

00:05:57.710 --> 00:06:01.170
Maybe I should get a part time job, after all.

00:06:01.170 --> 00:06:03.250
That way you could get by a bit easier, right?

00:06:04.710 --> 00:06:05.760
Idiot!

00:06:05.760 --> 00:06:07.840
Don't worry so much about things.

00:06:08.340 --> 00:06:10.800
You should focus more on your studies!

00:06:12.850 --> 00:06:13.470
Wake up!

00:06:23.150 --> 00:06:26.820
For the past five years, we've had nothing but the same results.

00:06:26.820 --> 00:06:29.990
It's a far cry from the Zet you requested.

00:06:29.990 --> 00:06:33.330
This thing is just another poorly made Player.

00:06:33.330 --> 00:06:34.240
Why?!

00:06:34.240 --> 00:06:37.330
If we have Kanzaki's data, why can't we make it?

00:06:37.870 --> 00:06:40.250
We should search for the real thing.

00:06:40.250 --> 00:06:43.170
Kanzaki alone is insufficient!

00:06:43.170 --> 00:06:46.590
You must realise this as well, Mr. Chairman.

00:06:52.430 --> 00:06:54.890
No surprise that it won't work anymore.

00:06:54.890 --> 00:06:56.520
What happened?

00:06:56.520 --> 00:06:58.930
I met Konoha today.

00:06:58.930 --> 00:07:01.560
Oh! The younger sister of that kid from before, right?

00:07:02.020 --> 00:07:04.400
She was helping people, as always.

00:07:05.270 --> 00:07:07.740
You don't help people anymore?

00:07:07.740 --> 00:07:09.740
I'm helping you, aren't I?

00:07:11.950 --> 00:07:13.910
You've gotten smart!

00:07:13.910 --> 00:07:14.950
Ouch!

00:07:27.800 --> 00:07:32.010
I'll now introduce to you the eleven amazing members...

00:07:32.010 --> 00:07:35.220
...of the Kouka Junior High School soccer team!

00:07:35.760 --> 00:07:37.510
Amagi Kouga-kun!

00:07:39.140 --> 00:07:39.680
Yes!

00:07:40.390 --> 00:07:41.310
Kouga-kun!

00:07:45.310 --> 00:07:46.690
Konoha.

00:08:01.120 --> 00:08:04.460
You've really grown up, Konoha!

00:08:04.460 --> 00:08:07.420
It's been a long time, Ojii-sama.

00:08:19.680 --> 00:08:23.730
Now, Kouga-kun, please tell us about your future ambitions.

00:08:26.860 --> 00:08:28.270
Everyone,

00:08:28.270 --> 00:08:31.070
you all know about the consecutive arson incidents recently, right?

00:08:33.110 --> 00:08:35.240
There have been a lot of victims in this,

00:08:35.240 --> 00:08:37.950
and I want the culprit to be captured as soon as possible!

00:08:38.330 --> 00:08:42.080
Or rather, I'd really like to capture the culprit myself!

00:08:42.080 --> 00:08:45.830
Everyone, if you have any information, please tell me!

00:08:47.790 --> 00:08:49.460
T-That's right, isn't it?

00:08:49.460 --> 00:08:52.590
It'd be great if the arsonist could be captured as soon as possible.

00:08:53.090 --> 00:08:56.760
By the way, Kouga-kun, what do you want to be when you grow up?

00:08:58.640 --> 00:09:00.850
My dream is to be an Ally of Justice!

00:09:05.390 --> 00:09:06.480
So cute!

00:09:12.280 --> 00:09:15.360
Today I met Jin-kun in Undertown!

00:09:15.780 --> 00:09:16.910
Really?!

00:09:16.910 --> 00:09:18.530
Yeah, really.

00:09:18.530 --> 00:09:21.620
But he went off somewhere, so I couldn't chase after him...

00:09:22.120 --> 00:09:23.790
Today's a great day!

00:09:23.790 --> 00:09:24.460
Huh?

00:09:27.830 --> 00:09:29.590
Kouga-kun, we're taking off!

00:09:30.340 --> 00:09:31.170
Right.

00:09:31.840 --> 00:09:36.130
You met Jin on the day we're starting our patrol again.

00:09:36.130 --> 00:09:37.930
This definitely means something!

00:09:37.930 --> 00:09:42.350
"We"? Did you just say "we"?!

00:09:47.810 --> 00:09:50.980
Like I thought... Something stinks!

00:09:55.780 --> 00:09:58.610
We've got equipment for every kind of situation.

00:09:58.610 --> 00:10:01.370
Everybody developed this just for me!

00:10:01.370 --> 00:10:03.490
Do you all work for our company?

00:10:03.790 --> 00:10:07.500
Well, we were moved by Kouga's hopes.

00:10:08.000 --> 00:10:10.130
If we can be of some use with our technical skills,

00:10:10.130 --> 00:10:12.460
nothing could make us happier.

00:10:13.880 --> 00:10:14.380
We got it!

00:10:14.800 --> 00:10:16.630
There's a fire breaking out in district 15!

00:10:17.010 --> 00:10:19.510
Let's hurry! The criminal must still be nearby.

00:10:21.050 --> 00:10:21.890
What's that?

00:10:21.890 --> 00:10:22.890
Fireproof gel.

00:10:23.390 --> 00:10:25.680
It'll protect your body from fire.

00:10:25.680 --> 00:10:29.390
Since I'll have to go inside to catch the criminal.

00:10:29.900 --> 00:10:30.900
Hold on!

00:10:30.900 --> 00:10:32.360
Getting the criminal's fine and all,

00:10:32.360 --> 00:10:34.570
but what if there are people trapped in there?

00:10:34.570 --> 00:10:37.070
That's the fire fighters' job!

00:10:37.070 --> 00:10:39.450
My objective is to prevent crime.

00:10:39.450 --> 00:10:40.660
To capture the arsonist.

00:10:41.120 --> 00:10:42.280
Anything else comes second to that.

00:10:42.280 --> 00:10:44.080
It can't be helped.

00:10:44.830 --> 00:10:49.250
Kouga-kun, take the helmet just in case.

00:10:49.250 --> 00:10:50.170
No way.

00:10:51.420 --> 00:10:52.420
It looks dumb.

00:10:53.630 --> 00:10:55.170
I'll be fine with this!

00:11:00.800 --> 00:11:02.680
It's this scent.

00:11:07.890 --> 00:11:09.520
I can smell it!

00:11:09.520 --> 00:11:11.100
I was waiting...

00:11:11.100 --> 00:11:13.020
...for this scent!

00:11:27.620 --> 00:11:30.040
It's reacting to a heat source in the building next door.

00:11:30.540 --> 00:11:32.040
The criminal's moved!

00:11:43.890 --> 00:11:45.890
I feel so refreshed.

00:11:52.270 --> 00:11:55.400
Hey. You're the thing I was smelling, aren't you.

00:11:57.610 --> 00:11:59.820
You smell, too.

00:11:59.820 --> 00:12:02.990
You smell like we do!

00:12:04.070 --> 00:12:06.450
Konoha, you just follow the plan after this.

00:12:06.450 --> 00:12:08.870
I really have to do this too?

00:12:08.870 --> 00:12:11.040
Of course, it's just like we used to!

00:12:11.410 --> 00:12:13.170
We're a team!

00:12:15.460 --> 00:12:16.540
I'm going!

00:12:16.540 --> 00:12:18.710
My first job as an Ally of Justice.

00:12:26.930 --> 00:12:29.680
Just as expected. It cleared up in an instant!

00:12:31.060 --> 00:12:32.680
I made it.

00:12:33.600 --> 00:12:35.560
This is the worst!

00:12:53.040 --> 00:12:54.000
Jin!

00:12:55.170 --> 00:12:56.500
Is that you, Kouga?

00:13:03.300 --> 00:13:04.720
This is awesome, right?!

00:13:04.720 --> 00:13:06.800
It's an anaerobic extinguishing spray.

00:13:07.300 --> 00:13:09.350
You haven't changed a bit.

00:13:15.100 --> 00:13:15.690
Children?

00:13:17.020 --> 00:13:17.940
She's alive.

00:13:18.360 --> 00:13:19.310
Let's save them.

00:13:29.370 --> 00:13:31.120
Let's leave the mother!

00:13:35.120 --> 00:13:38.290
Konoha, I'm with Jin right now.

00:13:38.290 --> 00:13:39.500
Jin-kun?!

00:13:39.500 --> 00:13:40.880
The situation's changed.

00:13:40.880 --> 00:13:42.630
I'm prioritizing saving people.

00:13:43.130 --> 00:13:45.880
Please shoot a wire here, just like I told you before.

00:13:45.880 --> 00:13:48.760
Got it! I'll give it a try.

00:13:52.470 --> 00:13:54.560
Hey! What're you doing?

00:13:55.890 --> 00:13:57.730
W-What's that?!

00:13:57.730 --> 00:13:59.940
The floor collapsed all the way to the basement.

00:14:01.570 --> 00:14:03.690
I was waiting for this time to come.

00:14:04.440 --> 00:14:06.950
Hey! Get inside the futon.

00:14:06.950 --> 00:14:09.360
Jin! It's impossible to save them all!

00:14:09.360 --> 00:14:11.580
If you let your feelings get in the way, they'll all die.

00:14:11.580 --> 00:14:14.950
Even if we just stick to your plan, they'll die.

00:14:15.500 --> 00:14:16.580
That's not true!

00:14:17.330 --> 00:14:19.080
Everyone hold hands tightly.

00:14:19.790 --> 00:14:22.170
Protect your mum, OK?

00:14:22.170 --> 00:14:22.840
Right!

00:14:23.340 --> 00:14:24.590
All right.

00:14:27.090 --> 00:14:30.180
Stop it! My plan isn't wrong.

00:14:30.180 --> 00:14:32.350
It's the best choice in our current situation!

00:14:33.390 --> 00:14:37.770
Do you understand the feelings of a kid with no parents?

00:14:37.770 --> 00:14:39.190
Stop it!

00:14:39.980 --> 00:14:41.190
You can't be...

00:14:41.190 --> 00:14:43.440
This is too dangerous!

00:14:44.110 --> 00:14:45.860
Do you want to kill them all?!

00:14:48.320 --> 00:14:49.240
Of course not.

00:14:49.240 --> 00:14:51.070
But if they die, then they'll all die together,

00:14:51.070 --> 00:14:52.240
so at least they won't be lonely.

00:14:53.530 --> 00:14:54.990
What the hell did you just do?!

00:14:55.700 --> 00:14:58.620
You were going to abandon their mother.

00:15:04.630 --> 00:15:05.550
Jin!

00:15:07.260 --> 00:15:09.090
Onii-chan! What about Jin-kun?

00:15:09.090 --> 00:15:09.590
It's no good.

00:15:10.840 --> 00:15:12.010
I'm coming out!

00:15:13.600 --> 00:15:15.930
I could catch the criminal?

00:15:15.930 --> 00:15:18.140
When I couldn't even...

00:15:20.390 --> 00:15:22.060
...save people!

00:15:27.530 --> 00:15:28.860
Who are you?!

00:15:29.740 --> 00:15:31.410
Perfect timing!

00:15:34.410 --> 00:15:35.660
Interesting.

00:15:45.040 --> 00:15:48.000
I'm so glad they're all safe!

00:15:48.000 --> 00:15:50.510
Amazing! Did you save them all?!

00:15:54.010 --> 00:15:56.010
What an amazing scene.

00:15:56.300 --> 00:15:59.270
It looks like a civilian boy helped in the rescue.

00:15:59.270 --> 00:16:00.930
He really stood out, huh.

00:16:00.930 --> 00:16:01.770
There's applause.

00:16:01.770 --> 00:16:03.770
The people around him are starting to applaud!

00:16:04.310 --> 00:16:05.150
Konoha-chan!

00:16:05.150 --> 00:16:07.400
There's something bugging me!

00:16:14.030 --> 00:16:15.200
How is it?

00:16:15.200 --> 00:16:18.160
The wound you created on my right arm,

00:16:18.160 --> 00:16:20.540
my little flames have healed it.

00:16:20.540 --> 00:16:22.910
As long as I have flames, I'm invincible!

00:16:22.910 --> 00:16:25.500
Humans can't do things like this!

00:16:25.500 --> 00:16:28.750
We're way better than humans!

00:16:28.750 --> 00:16:32.920
So why do we have to be the ones living in secrecy?

00:16:32.920 --> 00:16:36.260
Why do we have to disguise ourselves as humans?

00:16:37.260 --> 00:16:39.600
You sure talk a lot.

00:16:40.520 --> 00:16:46.020
How about you tell me what the hell you guys are right now?

00:16:52.900 --> 00:16:54.490
Hurry up and die.

00:17:23.520 --> 00:17:25.810
I see.

00:17:25.810 --> 00:17:27.730
This is...

00:17:37.910 --> 00:17:39.490
Charisma?!

00:17:40.740 --> 00:17:42.740
What're you talking about?

00:17:45.500 --> 00:17:49.420
North-east, approximately 50 kilometres away.

00:17:49.420 --> 00:17:50.960
I don't have any hands free for this.

00:17:50.960 --> 00:17:53.000
There are too many today.

00:17:54.090 --> 00:17:56.010
It's the night of a full moon...

00:18:15.570 --> 00:18:18.570
I'm feeling great.

00:18:25.620 --> 00:18:28.830
Oh? The flames are healing your arm?

00:18:53.190 --> 00:18:56.070
His toys are pretty handy.

00:19:41.110 --> 00:19:42.160
This is bad...

00:20:25.740 --> 00:20:27.720
You! This place is dangerous.

00:20:27.720 --> 00:20:28.920
Get back!

00:20:30.370 --> 00:20:32.580
Confirming one person in need of emergency medical help!

00:20:33.040 --> 00:20:34.420
He's in cardiac arrest!

00:20:36.290 --> 00:20:38.590
Why do we need to have a press conference?

00:20:39.630 --> 00:20:41.260
The one who saved that family was-

00:20:41.260 --> 00:20:43.340
It's starting in 30 minutes. Got it?

00:20:43.340 --> 00:20:44.680
No!

00:20:44.680 --> 00:20:46.050
Don't speak so selfishly.

00:20:46.050 --> 00:20:47.850
That's enough, Seizou.

00:20:48.510 --> 00:20:52.600
Kouga, you won't do things like this from now on, right?

00:20:53.730 --> 00:20:57.690
I want to work for justice.

00:20:57.690 --> 00:21:01.110
The concept of justice is difficult to pin down.

00:21:01.530 --> 00:21:06.110
If you want to wield justice, then gain authority!

00:21:09.160 --> 00:21:11.120
Jin-kun won't die, right?!

00:21:12.950 --> 00:21:14.790
He's the kid with the angel's ring...

00:21:16.210 --> 00:21:20.590
Jin-kun is the one who really saved that family!

00:21:20.590 --> 00:21:22.260
Angel's ring...?

00:21:32.180 --> 00:21:34.850
Today's a fantastic day!

00:21:34.850 --> 00:21:36.850
Isn't it, Zet?

00:21:56.660 --> 00:21:57.960
Oba-san!

00:22:10.390 --> 00:22:16.340
Your birthday comes,

00:22:16.340 --> 00:22:23.180
and I pick a present for you.

00:22:23.180 --> 00:22:29.460
I stop my feet on fifth street.

00:22:29.460 --> 00:22:36.130
This love can't be changed.

00:22:38.710 --> 00:22:45.690
Darling, stop the clock, stop your head,

00:22:45.690 --> 00:22:51.510
stop your heart, your eyes and ears, and everything.

00:22:51.510 --> 00:22:58.350
Darling, all the words I received from you.

00:22:58.350 --> 00:23:09.770
Hugging you as if embracing a rose with no thorns.

00:23:09.770 --> 00:23:17.410
Darling, the miracle of the two of us meeting in this world.

00:23:17.410 --> 00:23:28.860
With only a trace of that, me loving you.

00:23:35.620 --> 00:23:37.430
Preview of Next Episode

00:23:37.430 --> 00:23:37.600
Onii-chan, what is your "justice"?
Preview of Next Episode

00:23:37.600 --> 00:23:38.430
Onii-chan, what is your "justice"?

00:23:38.430 --> 00:23:38.960
You... Shut up.
Onii-chan, what is your "justice"?

00:23:38.960 --> 00:23:41.600
You're wrong! Alphas is perfect!

00:23:41.600 --> 00:23:41.850
Why did you kill Oba-san?!
You're wrong! Alphas is perfect!

00:23:41.850 --> 00:23:42.630
Why did you kill Oba-san?!

00:23:42.630 --> 00:23:43.150
Tears
Why did you kill Oba-san?!

00:23:43.150 --> 00:23:45.340
Victory is mine!
Tears

00:23:45.340 --> 00:23:45.600
Tears
